<div class="col-sm-4">
<div class="card"><img alt="person at computer" data-entity-type="file" height="100%" src="https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/pexels-yan-krukau-8613089_0.jpg" width="100%" loading="lazy" /><div class="card-body">
<p>According to the Coalition for Community Schools: "Community schools strategy transforms a school into a place where educators, local community members, families, and students work together to strengthen conditions for student learning and healthy development. As partners, they organize in- and out-of-school resources, supports, and opportunities so that young people thrive."</p>

<p><a data-auth="Verified" data-linkindex="1" href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.communityschools.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121903150%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=KdszeNjbdQGGp9Z2gWt327e2NZMiyx8Jz0SP3LxSODw%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" title="Original URL: https://www.communityschools.org/. Click or tap if you trust this link.">https://www.communityschools.org/</a></p>
